    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Launching soon are a selection of one bedroom own door apartments with west facing terrace in the ever popular development of Curragh Farm in Newbridge.\r\n\r\nThis prestigious development provides an opportunity to establish roots in an idyllic and exclusive setting, while also enjoying superb local amenities and ease of access to Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nLocal amenities include:\r\n• The Curragh Racecourse\r\n• The Curragh Golf Club\r\n• White Water Shopping Centre\r\n\r\nThe specialist design team have carefully crafted these spaces to compliment the idyllic rural surrounds and provide delightful results using only the finest finishes.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features:\r\n• A Rated\r\n• High Quality Kitchens\r\n• Easy access to the N7 & M7\r\n• Approved for ‘Help to Buy Scheme’\r\n• 2.6KM to Newbridge Train Station\r\n\r\n** Help to Buy and First Home Schemes available** \r\n\r\nPlease contact Savills New Homes on 01 6181300 for further information or register your interest on curraghfarm.ie"
      },
